gations of misconduct. The Jeanne Clery Disclosure of Campus Security Policy and Campus Crime Statistics Act or Clery Act Notification can be found at Clery Act Notification . Advertised: May 21, 2026 (9:00 AM) Pacific Daylight Time Applications close: May 31, 2027 (11:55 PM) Pacific Daylight Time Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Ok, we will send you jobs like this. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Position Location Open Date Close Date Lecturer Pool - Pediatrics/Obstetrics Pool AY26/27 San Marcos May 21, 2026 May 31, 2027 The School of Nursing at California State University San Marcos accepts applications on an on-going basis for our Pediatrics/OB pool of part-time lecturers. Clinical days, hours, and clinical sites vary within San Diego County and Riverside County. Hiring Pools Loading... Current Opportunities Position Location Open Date Close Date Lecturer Pool - Pediatrics/Obstetrics Pool AY26/27 San Marcos May 21, 2026 May 31, 2027 The School of Nursing at California State University San Marcos accepts applications on an on-going basis for our Pediatrics/OB pool of part-time lecturers. Clinical days, hours, and clinical sites vary within San Diego County and Riverside County. Powered by PageUp Job search e.g. \"Director, Technology\" Refine search Work type Instructional Faculty - Temporary/Lecturer 1 Locations Southern California San Marcos 1 Categories Appointment Type Temporary 1 Bargaining Unit Unit 3 - CFA - California Faculty Association 1 Job Search Category/Discipline Faculty - Health Sciences 1 Time Basis Part Time 1 Outstanding Benefits and Perks When it comes to treating our employees right, our priorities include providing an\n                        outstanding benefits package. After all, once you become a Co